20260529.114657.414 [>kpop..........] - No cheezy dev-speak (e.g., "bolt that on", "fire-and-forget", "duct tape")
20260529.114657.414 [>kpop..........] - No colloquialisms
20260529.114657.414 [>kpop..........] - Write in clear, plain language.
20260529.114657.414 [>kpop..........] - Use complete sentences.
